{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and take it, check weight, properties, do specific task, then move to destination. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    />  <Action ID = ApproachObject    />  <Action ID = PickUpObject    />  <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    />  <Action ID = ScanObjectProperties    />  <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />  <Action ID = MoveToDestination    />",
    "BT": {
